{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 7, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "solve a*x^2 + b*x + c = 0 for x\n  x = (-b + sqrt(b^2 - 4a*c))/(2a)\n  x = (-b - sqrt(b^2 - 4a*c))/(2a)\n  where a != 0 (else the equation is linear)\n  real when the discriminant b^2 - 4a*c >= 0\n  check: x = the first substituted, the equation holds at 42 sample points of the other variables (residual 1.4e-13)\n  check: x = the second substituted, the equation holds at 42 sample points of the other variables (residual 1.2e-14)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 7, "ok": true, "cmd": "solve", "ucas": "solve a*x^2 + b*x + c = 0 for x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "solve", "equations": ["a*x^2 + b*x + c = 0"], "unknowns": ["x"], "solutions": [{"x": "(-b + sqrt(b^2 - 4a*c))/(2a)"}, {"x": "(-b - sqrt(b^2 - 4a*c))/(2a)"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": ["a != 0", "b^2 - 4a*c >= 0 (real solutions)"], "checks": [{"kind": "substitution", "points": 42, "max_diff": 1.3589129821411916e-13, "passed": true}, {"kind": "substitution", "points": 42, "max_diff": 1.1546319456101628e-14, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "solve a*x^2 + b*x + c = 0 for x\n  x = (-b + sqrt(b^2 - 4a*c))/(2a)\n  x = (-b - sqrt(b^2 - 4a*c))/(2a)\n  where a != 0 (else the equation is linear)\n  real when the discriminant b^2 - 4a*c >= 0\n  check: x = the first substituted, the equation holds at 42 sample points of the other variables (residual 1.4e-13)\n  check: x = the second substituted, the equation holds at 42 sample points of the other variables (residual 1.2e-14)\n"}, "isError": false}}
